Giorgi (G-049): in „ბოლო სიახლეები" updates of the same case go under one
title of 3–4 words. Each row now carries case_title, the case thread's
short_title (null until written), so the app groups by thread_id and draws
the title once. Additive; nothing else changes. FOR_FRONTEND has the field.

